{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_05_j",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7aca20e4c92e073da30af3ae569c891010727b9e384cdcaae49bac06a06a2216",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_j:cmd-000022:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:188c35d7729d74913c5e131fc78f59cc3fe1803a539dbc1f794d40a1f9c7a1e4",
      "text": "演出当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_j:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01496ac1341f69adeba34469987901759cdcb79f9d36f2aeba6e37d3c7010e00",
      "text": "男极‘同步部门’的优胜者是……。\n来自315 Production的彩！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_j:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20a49f975464e1758caecf835a2a043d905d774274ecd626979c97413fd45fb1",
      "text": "精彩地贴近了信中蕴含的心意，\n为我们带来了美妙绝伦的舞台表演！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_j:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa16410cb3057c985cf2a8d39dffd966bdd9f1a77005f162b9231950ce6cc183",
      "text": "这次舞台能取得成功，\n绝不仅仅是靠我们自己的力量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_j:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:554767bdd4b2727ae940418bc6ea702cf90edd25fd71bfa6f2081fd55836582b",
      "text": "在下等人的技艺，正是因为有先辈开辟出的\n道路，才得以诞生的喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_j:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd315e3008d4865777a54038465c1e4fc06f4462bbda3963c40491ba350b868d",
      "text": "如果能由现在的我们，把继承而来的技艺\n以最完美的形式传达给大家，那就太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_j:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d962555ce39f7b6d7e6f85591557d276ef0b29f4a9b82a4c65371b45e33075dc",
      "text": "现场的观众和屏幕前的各位，\n也请多多接触我们所热爱的歌舞伎、落语以及茶道♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_j:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42ae7d920a08a9fdebef0604afc88ac21a39c42e5ea56100f645f1099e0a3ac1",
      "text": "感受这些至今流传的\n传统艺能吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_j:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:034002ff81b3ab5b2a5b37fa6402dd0c4f7253186877296558d69baffb4c6532",
      "text": "居然是315 Pro获胜了！？那帮家伙拿到的信，\n明明是我老家库房里吃灰的东西……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_j:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:946574827b677ec529d13a729b1b5839f31d755bd8a4732da0bf083c097ccba2",
      "text": "说什么“先辈开辟的道路”。\n什么“继承而来的技艺”！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_j:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c436e42d765641bdb35f07f1d6d7f607c6604713d42705c20382e9add93c800",
      "text": "那帮家伙说的话和技术全是一派胡言！\n只是擅长装模作样的演技罢了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_j:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:641719334e63b3f6b9670b450cdcf031d2acdada1d4bd35f8407d6cd9cabcb99",
      "text": "没错！下次，我一定要彻底瓦解他们的演技。\n绝不能再让他们继续得意忘形下去了！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
